const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"允许方差不同，仍要求观测独立",en:"Different variances do not remove independence requirements"},body:{zh:"White允许观测不是同分布，但开头仍明确要求观测向量相互独立，并对解释变量与误差施加正交条件。这扩大了通常同方差模型的范围，却没有把任意时间相关或同组相关都包含进来；金融面板往往需要进一步处理依赖。",en:"White allows observations to be non-identically distributed, while retaining independence and regressor-error orthogonality. This broadens homoskedastic regression without covering arbitrary serial or within-group dependence. Financial panels often require additional treatment of dependence."},reference:{url:"https://crooker.faculty.unlv.edu/econ441/econ_papers/White-Heteroskedasticity-Correction-1980.pdf",label:{zh:"1980年期刊版 · §2 · Assumption 1",en:"1980 journal article · §2 · Assumption 1"}}},{title:{zh:"系数一致性和标准误正确性分开",en:"Coefficient consistency and valid standard errors are separate"},body:{zh:"论文先在条件下建立OLS系数的一致性，再讨论系数估计量的分布与协方差。异方差可能使常规标准误失真，却不必然使OLS系数失去一致性。反过来，换一个稳健协方差公式也不能让本来内生的解释变量变得外生。",en:"The paper establishes OLS consistency before deriving its distribution and covariance. Heteroskedasticity can invalidate conventional standard errors without making coefficients inconsistent. Conversely, replacing a covariance formula cannot make an endogenous regressor exogenous."},reference:{url:"https://crooker.faculty.unlv.edu/econ441/econ_papers/White-Heteroskedasticity-Correction-1980.pdf",label:{zh:"1980年期刊版 · §2 · Lemmas 1–2",en:"1980 journal article · §2 · Lemmas 1–2"}}},{title:{zh:"不必分别估出每个观测的真实方差",en:"Individual error variances need not be estimated separately"},body:{zh:"关键是估计解释变量与误差平方构成的平均矩，而不是为每个观测估计一个独立的方差参数。论文用OLS残差平方代替不可观测的误差平方。这个构造依赖大样本条件，不是在声称一个残差就准确测出了该观测的风险。",en:"The key object is an average regressor-weighted error moment, not a separate variance parameter for every observation. Squared OLS residuals replace unobserved squared errors. This is an asymptotic construction, not a claim that one residual accurately measures individual risk."},reference:{url:"https://crooker.faculty.unlv.edu/econ441/econ_papers/White-Heteroskedasticity-Correction-1980.pdf",label:{zh:"1980年期刊版 · §2 · p. 820",en:"1980 journal article · §2 · p. 820"}}},{title:{zh:"三明治中间部分承担异方差信息",en:"The sandwich middle carries heteroskedasticity information"},body:{zh:"协方差估计保留设计矩阵的两侧逆矩阵，中间改用残差平方加权的解释变量乘积。回归系数本身不因此改变，但置信区间和检验可能变化。稳健标准误也不是必然更大，其大小取决于误差变异与解释变量之间的实际关系。",en:"The covariance estimator keeps inverse design matrices on both sides and uses residual-weighted regressor products in the middle. Coefficients remain unchanged, while intervals and tests may change. Robust standard errors need not be larger; their size depends on the variance pattern."},reference:{url:"https://crooker.faculty.unlv.edu/econ441/econ_papers/White-Heteroskedasticity-Correction-1980.pdf",label:{zh:"1980年期刊版 · §2 · Theorem 1",en:"1980 journal article · §2 · Theorem 1"}}},{title:{zh:"渐近正态不等于精确的小样本分布",en:"Asymptotic normality is not an exact small-sample law"},body:{zh:"定理给出的推断建立在矩有界、矩阵可逆和样本增长等条件上，使用渐近正态或卡方结果。不能把软件显示的t样式统计量理解为自动具有经典小样本t分布。样本少或少数高杠杆观测主导时，近似误差尤其值得单独检查。",en:"Inference relies on moment bounds, nonsingular matrices and growing samples, yielding asymptotic normal or chi-squared results. A t-shaped statistic in software does not automatically have the classical exact t distribution. Small or highly leveraged samples warrant separate scrutiny."},reference:{url:"https://crooker.faculty.unlv.edu/econ441/econ_papers/White-Heteroskedasticity-Correction-1980.pdf",label:{zh:"1980年期刊版 · §2 · pp. 820–821",en:"1980 journal article · §2 · pp. 820–821"}}},{title:{zh:"检验协方差设定，不是给模型颁发合格证",en:"A covariance diagnostic is not a certificate for the model"},body:{zh:"直接检验的出发点是比较两种对相关矩的估计是否一致，从而识别常规协方差公式可能失效的情形。即使没有拒绝，也不证明均值模型、因果解释或所有误差假设都成立。诊断回答的范围比整篇研究是否可信要窄得多。",en:"The direct-test discussion compares moment estimates to diagnose failure of the conventional covariance formula. Non-rejection does not validate the mean model, causal interpretation or every error assumption. A covariance diagnostic answers a narrower question than overall research credibility."},reference:{url:"https://crooker.faculty.unlv.edu/econ441/econ_papers/White-Heteroskedasticity-Correction-1980.pdf",label:{zh:"1980年期刊版 · §3 · pp. 821–822",en:"1980 journal article · §3 · pp. 821–822"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"异方差稳健标准误不能修复内生性、遗漏变量或序列相关。本文的独立观测与矩条件仍然重要，渐近推断也不等于小样本精确检验。",en:"Heteroskedasticity-robust standard errors do not repair endogeneity, omitted variables or serial dependence. Independence and moment conditions still matter, and asymptotic inference is not finite-sample exact."}};export{e as default};
